WEBVTT

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.000
det er 700 gange 666, plus 17 i anden,

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.000
det er 466.489,

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.000
skynd dig, tag de 466

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.780
og tilsæt det til opdelingen for at få

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:41.340
uha -

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:46.000
328.489

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.000
Publikum: Ja!

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:47.740
Godt.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:48.850
(Klapsalver)

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.310
Mange tak skal I have.

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:53.510
Jeg håber I nød matemagi. Tak.

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:57.000
(Klapsalver)